stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> QUEUED: Owner transaction accepts job
  QUEUED --> RUNNING: Atomic lease claim
  QUEUED --> CANCELLED: Cancel before start
  RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED: Current lease + allowed owner commit
  RUNNING --> QUEUED: Retryable failure under original job ID
  RUNNING --> FAILED: Terminal refusal or exhausted policy
  RUNNING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED: Cancel requested
  CANCEL_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED: Attempt settles or lease expires
  note right of SUCCEEDED
    Technical result; not automatic business completion
  end note
